slider34:0<0,12,1{Off,50 Hz,60 Hz,70 Hz,80 Hz,100 Hz,120 Hz,150 Hz,180 Hz,220 Hz,250 Hz,315 Hz,400 Hz}>-Bass Mono
slider35:0<-12,24,0.1>-Clip Drive (dB)
slider36:0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Clip IN
